Z||000004||California Kid||10-14-2001||10:34 PM||||Get rid of the Briggs, there's little Italian monsters (singles)out there that only weigh 14 pounds, and make 14hp. Heck, you find a dirt cheap motorcyle engine from a wrecked bike and have all kinds of fun.||||reg||1
Z||000005||ray b||10-14-2001||10:51 PM||||if you race the cart read the rules in b&s class<BR>if you just want it to go faster get a ford flathead hop up book<BR>hop ups basicly smooth out ports match gaskets releve the valves[remove extra metal between valves and piston] lighten crank/rebalance better rings and or piston<BR>biger carb.<P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||10
